{"type":"FeatureCollection","features":[{"type":"Feature","properties":{"id":"vol_kilauea","nameJa":"キラウエア火山（ハワイ）","volcanoType":"hotspot","volcanoTypeJa":"ホットスポット（プレート内部のマグマ上昇）","iso3":"USA","description":"ハワイ・ホットスポット上の盾状火山。玄武岩質マグマのため粘性が低く穏やかに溶岩が流出する。","photoUrl":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/40/Episode_4_of_Kilauea%27s_December_2024_eruption_2025-01-16.jpg/960px-Episode_4_of_Kilauea%27s_December_2024_eruption_2025-01-16.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","photoCaption":"ハワイ・キラウエア火山の穏やかな溶岩流出","photoCredit":"Wikimedia Commons（出典: Kīlauea）"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[-155.29,19.42]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"id":"vol_mauna_loa","nameJa":"マウナ・ロア（ハワイ）","volcanoType":"hotspot","volcanoTypeJa":"ホットスポット（プレート内部のマグマ上昇）","iso3":"USA","description":"ハワイ最大の盾状火山。太平洋プレートが北西へ移動することで火山島列（ハワイ諸島）が形成。","photoUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e0/Mauna_Loa_Volcano.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","photoCaption":"ハワイ・マウナ・ロアのなだらかな盾状火山","photoCredit":"Wikimedia Commons（出典: Mauna Loa）"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[-155.6,19.48]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"id":"vol_yellowstone","nameJa":"イエローストーン（カルデラ）","volcanoType":"hotspot","volcanoTypeJa":"ホットスポット（プレート内部のマグマ上昇）","iso3":"USA","description":"北アメリカ大陸内部のホットスポットにより形成された巨大カルデラと間欠泉群。","photoUrl":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0b/Aerial_image_of_Grand_Prismatic_Spring_%28view_from_the_south%29.jpg/960px-Aerial_image_of_Grand_Prismatic_Spring_%28view_from_the_south%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","photoCaption":"イエローストーン・カルデラの熱水間欠泉","photoCredit":"Wikimedia Commons（出典: Grand Prismatic Spring）"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[-110.59,44.43]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"id":"vol_teide","nameJa":"テイデ山（カナリア諸島）","volcanoType":"hotspot","volcanoTypeJa":"ホットスポット（プレート内部のマグマ上昇）","iso3":"ESP","descri